# oracle: fix rigid/small molecule bodies under fix deform erate x y with remap x (the bodies' centres of mass follow the box)
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-10 abs=1e-12 atomrel=1e-10 skip=press,pxx,pyy,pzz
# Measured with native LAMMPS (black box, probe runs): before the fix the temp column was off by 1e-4 relative at step 5; with the fix every thermo column except the pressure ones agrees to 1e-10, and so do the final positions, velocities and forces of all 64 atoms. The pressure columns are left out for the same pre-existing rigid virial difference (about 1e-8 absolute, also without fix deform; see w178rd_rigid_custom).
units           lj
atom_style      molecular
lattice         sc 0.5
region          box block 0 4 0 4 0 4
create_box      1 box bond/types 1 extra/bond/per/atom 1 extra/special/per/atom 1
create_atoms    1 box
mass            1 1.0
variable        mid atom floor(x/2.0)+3*floor(y/2.5)
set             group all mol v_mid
pair_style      lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff      1 1 1.0 1.0
timestep        0.002
comm_modify     cutoff 5.0
fix             1 all rigid/small molecule
variable        vx atom 0.3*sin(0.9*x+0.4*z)
variable        vy atom 0.3*cos(0.6*y+0.8*x)
variable        vz atom 0.3*sin(0.7*z-0.3*y)
velocity        all set v_vx v_vy v_vz units box
fix             2 all deform 1 x erate 0.05 y erate 0.05 remap x
thermo_style    custom step temp pe ke etotal press pxx pyy pzz lx ly lz vol
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          5
run             40
